OL,3,GNEWSAWorker at care home in BBC
OL,4,Ainvestigation given warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was among workers recorded in
OL,7,Fsecret at Castlehill Care Home in
OL,8,FInverness for a BBC documentary. The
OL,9,Fhome's owner, Morar Living, said it
OL,10,Ftook all matters relating to residents
OL,11,F"extremely seriously".
